<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's NAMA Co H1 1997 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi's NAMA Co H1 1997 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		2.71  vs     2.07</p>
<p> Investment income     4.23  vs     4.39</p>
